<DocsLayout
    title="Release Process"
    description="How Axon releases are published"
>
    <h1>Release Process</h1>

    <p>
        Axon uses GitHub Releases as the source of truth for changelog entries,
        release notes, and platform downloads.
    </p>

    <h2>Release Flow</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Version is bumped in the editor package files</li>
        <li>CHANGELOG.md and docs/releases/v&lt;version&gt;.md are updated</li>
        <li>
            A version tag is pushed and GitHub Actions builds platform assets
        </li>
        <li>
            The GitHub release is published with notes and marked as the latest
            release
        </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Versioning</h2>
    <p>
        Axon follows <a href="https://semver.org/">Semantic Versioning</a>:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Major</strong> — Incompatible API changes</li>
        <li>
            <strong>Minor</strong> — New functionality, backwards compatible
        </li>
        <li><strong>Patch</strong> — Bug fixes, backwards compatible</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Build Assets</h2>
    <p>Each release produces the following assets:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>Axon-&#123;version&#125;-arm64.dmg</code> — macOS Apple Silicon</li>
        <li><code>Axon-&#123;version&#125;.dmg</code> — macOS Intel</li>
        <li><code>Axon.Setup.&#123;version&#125;.exe</code> — Windows installer</li>
        <li><code>Axon-&#123;version&#125;.AppImage</code> — Linux AppImage</li>
        <li>
            <code>axon_&#123;version&#125;_amd64.deb</code> — Linux Debian/Ubuntu package
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>macOS Signing</h2>
    <p>
        Current macOS builds are unsigned personal builds. For automatic in-app
        updates, the app would need to be signed and notarized by Apple. This is
        planned for a future release.
    </p>

    <h2>Update Process</h2>
    <p>
        Axon checks GitHub releases for newer versions. When an update is
        available:
    </p>
    <ol>
        <li>Open the update notice in Axon</li>
        <li>Download the correct release asset for your platform</li>
        <li>
            Replace the old app manually if the in-app updater cannot relaunch
        </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Nightly Builds</h2>
    <p>
        There are currently no automated nightly builds. Builds are published
        only for official releases.
    </p>
</DocsLayout>
